WEBVTT

00:00:05.206 --> 00:00:08.083
Hello? Dad? Ericka?

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.627
MURRAY:
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.795
-Murray?
-(Eunice screaming)

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:13.214
(Frank shouts, sobs)

00:00:13.297 --> 00:00:14.798
Hold me. I'm scared.

00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:16.884
-Huh?
-(Griffin sobbing)

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:18.344
Blobby?

00:00:18.427 --> 00:00:19.470
Whoa!

00:00:19.553 --> 00:00:20.596
(Wayne screaming)

00:00:20.679 --> 00:00:22.473
-Mavis!
-(screams)

00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:23.891
(groans) Ouchy.

00:00:23.974 --> 00:00:25.518
Oh, Dad, it's you.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.686
Yes, of course it's me.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.980
Ow. I think my nose is broken.

00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:31.357
What is going on?

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.901
-Did you find the crystal?
-Ugh, the crystal?

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:36.862
We can't even find each other.
It's cuckoo in here.

00:00:36.946 --> 00:00:38.864
(gasps)
But wait. You've come back.

00:00:38.948 --> 00:00:40.115
You're not mad anymore?

00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:41.700
Of course I'm still mad.

00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:43.327
But we need to save Johnny.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.204
-(Johnny roaring in distance)
-(both grunting)

00:00:45.287 --> 00:00:47.206
(pounding)

00:00:47.289 --> 00:00:49.625
(gasping, grunting)

00:00:51.502 --> 00:00:52.545
(gasps)

00:00:52.628 --> 00:00:54.630
(growling)

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.092
-Johnny?
-Oh, no.

00:00:58.175 --> 00:01:00.719
(growling)

00:01:00.803 --> 00:01:03.097
(roaring)

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.349
-(gasps)
-Mavis!

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.601
-You okay, Mavey?
-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:01:07.685 --> 00:01:09.103
Go, go, go!

00:01:09.186 --> 00:01:11.105
(gasping, straining)

00:01:20.072 --> 00:01:22.199
Keep moving, legs.

00:01:23.909 --> 00:01:25.536
(gasps)

00:01:25.619 --> 00:01:27.246
(screams)

00:01:27.329 --> 00:01:29.206
-Wendy, Wally, Wilma, Wyatt...
-Is this all of them?

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:30.749
Not even close!

00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.751
-(wolf pups clamoring)
-(screams)

00:01:32.835 --> 00:01:34.795
-(screams)
-Whoa!

00:01:34.878 --> 00:01:35.879
(grunts)

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:37.214
Huh?

00:01:37.298 --> 00:01:38.674
(screams)

00:01:39.758 --> 00:01:42.094
BOTH: If he ruins my hair,
I'm never gonna forgive him!

00:01:42.177 --> 00:01:43.262
(growls)

00:01:43.345 --> 00:01:45.222
(panting, grunting)

00:01:45.306 --> 00:01:46.682
Ooh.

00:01:49.893 --> 00:01:51.312
Huh?

00:01:53.147 --> 00:01:54.148
(screams)

00:01:54.231 --> 00:01:56.108
(whimpering)

00:01:56.191 --> 00:01:58.152
(screaming)

00:02:00.237 --> 00:02:02.156
(groans):
Oh. Huh?

00:02:04.158 --> 00:02:05.284
Is that...

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:07.369
The crystal! Thank you, Johnny!

00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:09.330
(Johnny roaring, pounding)

00:02:09.413 --> 00:02:10.998
DRACULA:
Go!

00:02:14.168 --> 00:02:15.377
(grunts)

00:02:20.257 --> 00:02:22.426
Please don't be too late.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:24.762
(grunting angrily)

00:02:24.845 --> 00:02:26.472
(grunts, gasps)

00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:28.599
(Johnny growls)

00:02:28.682 --> 00:02:30.142
(grunting)

00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:33.562
Whoa! Whoa!

00:02:33.646 --> 00:02:35.105
(Johnny growling, pounding)

00:02:37.024 --> 00:02:38.233
Whoa. (grunts)

00:02:42.196 --> 00:02:44.073
(yells)

00:02:44.156 --> 00:02:45.157
Huh?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.533
Hey, kiddo.

00:02:46.617 --> 00:02:48.285
Thanks, Uncle Frank. (gasps)

00:02:48.369 --> 00:02:49.995
That's it!

00:02:50.079 --> 00:02:51.413
I need to get up there!

00:02:51.497 --> 00:02:52.623
Don't worry.

00:02:52.706 --> 00:02:53.957
We got you covered!

00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:56.585
♪ ♪

00:02:56.669 --> 00:02:58.212
What are you standing around for?

00:02:58.295 --> 00:02:59.296
Go, go, go!

00:03:04.093 --> 00:03:05.803
(grunting)

00:03:08.847 --> 00:03:10.015
Stop moving.

00:03:10.099 --> 00:03:11.350
-Ow! Watch it!
-Let me get balanced.

00:03:11.433 --> 00:03:12.434
Ow!

00:03:12.518 --> 00:03:13.686
Okay, Mavis!

00:03:15.813 --> 00:03:17.231
Whoa! (gasping)

00:03:18.691 --> 00:03:20.150
(Eunice grunts)

00:03:20.234 --> 00:03:22.277
Ready, Murray?

00:03:22.361 --> 00:03:23.445
Murray?

00:03:23.529 --> 00:03:24.697
(snoring)

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.448
-Murray!
-(snorts)

00:03:26.532 --> 00:03:28.158
I'm awake! What are we doing?

00:03:28.242 --> 00:03:30.369
(grunting)

00:03:34.498 --> 00:03:36.125
-(growling)
-(grunts)

00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:39.128
Okay, Johnny, please still be in there.

00:03:39.211 --> 00:03:41.463
(straining)

00:03:43.048 --> 00:03:44.049
(gasps)

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:46.135
(whooshing)

00:03:48.053 --> 00:03:49.388
(roaring)

00:03:49.471 --> 00:03:50.514
What?

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:53.016
(screams)

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.852
(grunts)

00:03:54.935 --> 00:03:56.895
(gasps) We're too late.

00:03:56.979 --> 00:03:58.731
No! It can't be!

00:03:58.814 --> 00:04:00.149
-(footstep squishes)
-Huh?

00:04:02.109 --> 00:04:03.902
(groans, gasps)

00:04:03.986 --> 00:04:05.404
Sorry about this, Blobby.

00:04:07.698 --> 00:04:09.366
♪ ♪

00:04:11.285 --> 00:04:14.204
Johnny...!

00:04:14.997 --> 00:04:16.623
-Dad!
-(all gasp)

00:04:16.707 --> 00:04:19.376
(growling)

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.336
(grunts) Johnny!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.380
(roaring)

00:04:23.464 --> 00:04:24.548
(gasps)

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:26.633
(Dracula straining)

00:04:27.718 --> 00:04:30.345
Johnny? (grunts)

00:04:30.429 --> 00:04:34.224
Johnny, you are the marshmallow!

00:04:34.308 --> 00:04:35.434
Huh?

00:04:35.517 --> 00:04:36.518
ALL:
Huh?

00:04:36.602 --> 00:04:38.145
Wait, he had a marshmallow on him?

00:04:38.228 --> 00:04:41.815
You said that if I only saw
the worst in things,

00:04:41.899 --> 00:04:43.942
I would miss the best parts.

00:04:44.026 --> 00:04:46.028
And you were right.

00:04:46.111 --> 00:04:50.032
I was so worried that you would
ruin everything I cared about

00:04:50.115 --> 00:04:52.493
that I didn't see...

00:04:52.576 --> 00:04:54.745
I didn't see you.

00:04:54.828 --> 00:04:56.705
-(growling)
-Your-your kindness,

00:04:56.789 --> 00:04:58.791
y-your energy, your...

00:04:58.874 --> 00:05:01.335
your Johnnyness.

00:05:01.418 --> 00:05:05.005
Before you, my life was like
a burnt marshmallow,

00:05:05.088 --> 00:05:08.383
hard and crunchy and sad.

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:13.222
But you cracked it open
and became the ooey-gooey center

00:05:13.305 --> 00:05:15.098
of all of our lives.

00:05:15.182 --> 00:05:17.392
(sighs) We're dead.

00:05:17.476 --> 00:05:18.936
(stammers)

00:05:19.019 --> 00:05:23.899
What I'm trying to say is that
you are part of the family.

00:05:23.982 --> 00:05:25.651
My family.

00:05:25.734 --> 00:05:29.655
I can't believe it took becoming a human
to finally realize it.

00:05:29.738 --> 00:05:33.075
And I'm sorry it's taken me
so long to say it,

00:05:33.158 --> 00:05:35.869
and maybe now it's too late,

00:05:35.953 --> 00:05:41.124
but you taught me to look
for the good in everything.

00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:45.295
And now I see that so much
of the good in my life

00:05:45.379 --> 00:05:47.464
is because of you.

00:05:47.548 --> 00:05:49.758
JOHNNY:
(grunts) Dra...

00:05:49.842 --> 00:05:50.884
Drac?

00:05:50.968 --> 00:05:52.636
Johnny! (gasps)

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:54.513
Drac.

00:05:54.596 --> 00:05:56.056
(sighs)

00:05:56.139 --> 00:05:58.141
♪ ♪

